/P 890 0 R
/E (Rather than placing the camera directly in front of the primary mirror, GIT uses a secondary mirror to redirect the focused light through the telescope and onto the CCD detector. This activity helps children understand how mirrors can accurately guide light while preserving the image.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
